fixed cycle:
0 - 68s : green for cars, red for pedestrians
68s - 72s : yellow for cars, red for pedestrians
72s - 73s : red for all
73s - 81s : green for pedestrians, red for cars
81s - 91s : red for all
91s - 92s : red and yellow for cars, red for pedestrian